        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Funnybot, South Park, South Park (season 10), Tsst\n- Companies: Comedy Central\n- People: Trey Parker, Matt Stone\n- Topics: premiere dates, broadcast history, television seasons\n\nFacts:\n- The tenth season of South Park, an American animated television series created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, began airing on March 22, 2006.\n- Tsst is an episode from South Park season 10 in 2006.\n- Funnybot premiered in the United States on Comedy Central on May 4, 2011.\n- Funnybot was the first South Park episode to air in May since Tsst aired during season 10 in 2006.",
